description: |
  A post outdoors takes outdoor nails only: a hot-dip galvanized 16d common nail
  driven home, and a stainless 3.4 x 90 mm wire nail driven 40 mm. The bright
  16d of the indoor example has no mating with this post - 'nail-target-outdoor'
  mates 'nail-point-outdoor' and nothing else - so connecting one to it finds no
  ports to put it on.
links:
  - part: example/deck-post
    name: post

  - part: imperial:common/16d
    name: galvanized
    params: { coating: hot-dip-galvanized }
    connect:
      name: post
      toInstance: A
      toParams: { drive: 88.9 }

  - part: metric:flat/3.4x90
    name: stainless
    params: { material: "//pub/std/manufacturing/material/metal:ss-304" }
    connect:
      name: post
      toInstance: B
      toParams: { drive: 40 }
